{
  "suite": "day-progress",
  "description": "Progress of a day toward its targets, one entry per requested key, in the requested order. A meal's nutrient is unknown when its key is absent, and an unknown is never counted as 0: knownMeals counts the meals that have it. total = the sum of known values rounded half-up (kcal and g whole, mg and µg one decimal), null when no meal knows it. With t = the unrounded known sum (0 when unknown): reference = min, else max; percent = round-half-up(t / reference x 100), null with no reference. status: no min and no max -> no-target; t < min -> under; max set and t > max -> over; else ok. aboveUpperLimit = upperLimit set and t > upperLimit. unit from the target, else from the key suffix (Kcal -> kcal, Ug -> µg, Mg -> mg, else g).",
